 "details": "The checkUserPassword GraphQL query in Dgraph is vulnerable to Dgraph Query Language (DQL) injection. User-supplied password values are interpolated directly into a DQL checkpwd query without escaping or parameterization. An attacker can inject a password containing a double-quote character to break out of the DQL string literal and append arbitrary DQL query blocks.",
 "id": "GO-2026-5837",
